{"seq":36,"slug":"ai-application-patterns","title":"AI 应用模式","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns","rating":{"composite":4.24,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<p>本 hub 是构建 LLM 应用时的「模式选型与组合」总图：把单次调用、提示链、RAG、工具调用、单/多 Agent 这条复杂度递增的谱系讲清楚，给出何时升级、何时降级的决策框架，并补齐结构化输出、上下文工程、护栏三块生产化要点。核心立场只有一句——<strong>复杂度应当被证明，而不是被默认</strong>。面向已能调通模型 API、正要把原型推向生产的工程师。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>AI-LLM 板块里有多个主题与本 hub 相邻。本 hub 只回答「这个场景该用哪种模式、怎么组合」，每种模式的纵深实现交给对应专题 hub：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>来本 hub</th>\n<th>去对应专题 hub</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>该用工作流还是 Agent、该不该上 RAG</td>\n<td>是（选型与组合是本 hub 主线）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAG 的向量库/索引算法/嵌入维度等纵深</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><a href=\"../rag-knowledge-systems/\">08 RAG 知识系统</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检索算法（dense/sparse、LTR、重排模型）本身</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ai-search-retrieval/\">22 AI 搜索与检索</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Agent 概念、ReAct、框架（LangChain/LangGraph）实现</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ai-agent-development/\">03 AI Agent 开发</a>、<a href=\"../ai-agent-frameworks/\">26 Agent 框架</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多 Agent 的协调理论、通信、涌现</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><a href=\"../multi-agent-systems/\">52 多 Agent 系统</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>prompt 写法、思维链、输出格式控制</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><a href=\"../prompt-engineering/\">07 提示工程</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评测体系、可观测、追踪、漂移检测</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><a href=\"../llm-app-eval-observability/\">37 LLM 应用评测与可观测</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本/延迟优化、缓存、模型路由</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ai-cost-latency-optimization/\">38 成本与延迟优化</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提示注入、越狱、护栏的安全原理</td>\n<td>介绍应用侧防御层</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ai-safety-alignment/\">13 AI 安全与对齐</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：本 hub 是**「点菜的菜单与点菜原则」<strong>，上面那些 hub 是</strong>「每道菜的做法」**。先在本 hub 想清楚要哪几道，再到专题 hub 学怎么做。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>路径一：要把一个 AI 功能从原型推上生产（多数读者）</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"application-architectures/llm-app-anatomy\">LLM 应用的解剖结构</a> —— 建立流水线视角。</li>\n<li><a href=\"application-architectures/pattern-landscape\">模式全景</a> → <a href=\"application-architectures/pattern-selection\">模式选型</a> —— 定位你的需求落在谱系哪一段。</li>\n<li>按选型结果选读对应模式族：知识问答走第 2 章 RAG，操作类走第 3 章工具与 Agent。</li>\n<li>收尾必读第 4 章生产集成（结构化输出 → 上下文工程 → 护栏），这是「能演示」到「能上线」的分水岭。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>路径二：只想做知识问答 / 企业搜索</strong>\n解剖结构 → 模式选型（确认 RAG 确实是对的）→ 第 2 章三篇通读 → 需要纵深时跳 <a href=\"../rag-knowledge-systems/\">08</a>/<a href=\"../ai-search-retrieval/\">22</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>路径三：要做能执行动作的 Agent</strong>\n模式选型（先确认 Agent 不是过度设计）→ 第 3 章三篇 → 上线前回到第 4 章的护栏与上下文工程 → 概念/框架纵深去 <a href=\"../ai-agent-development/\">03</a>/<a href=\"../ai-agent-frameworks/\">26</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>能用任一模型 SDK 跑通一次请求/响应，理解 token、上下文窗口、流式输出等基本概念（不熟可先看 <a href=\"../prompt-engineering/prompt-fundamentals/\">07 提示工程的基础章</a>）。</li>\n<li>具备一般后端工程素养：API、并发、重试、持久化、可观测——本 hub 大量讨论把这些工程实践套用到 LLM 的非确定性上。</li>\n<li>不要求机器学习背景：本 hub 站在应用工程师而非模型训练者的视角，把模型当作一个有特定失败模式的黑盒组件来集成。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"application-architectures","title":"Application Architectures","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns/application-architectures","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"llm-app-anatomy","title":"LLM 应用的解剖结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns/application-architectures/llm-app-anatomy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pattern-landscape","title":"模式全景：从单次调用到多 Agent 系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns/application-architectures/pattern-landscape"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pattern-selection","title":"模式选型：决策框架与常见误判","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns/application-architectures/pattern-selection"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"rag-patterns","title":"Rag Patterns","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns/rag-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rag-pipeline","title":"RAG 流水线：从文档到答案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns/rag-patterns/rag-pipeline"},{"seq":2,"slug":"chunking-and-retrieval","title":"分块与检索策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns/rag-patterns/chunking-and-retrieval"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rag-quality-failure-modes","title":"RAG 质量与失败模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns/rag-patterns/rag-quality-failure-modes"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"agent-and-tool-use","title":"Agent And Tool Use","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns/agent-and-tool-use","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tool-use-fundamentals","title":"工具调用基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns/agent-and-tool-use/tool-use-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"agent-loops-planning","title":"Agent 循环与规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns/agent-and-tool-use/agent-loops-planning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-agent-orchestration","title":"多 Agent 编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns/agent-and-tool-use/multi-agent-orchestration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"production-integration","title":"Production Integration","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns/production-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"structured-output-validation","title":"结构化输出与校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns/production-integration/structured-output-validation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"context-engineering","title":"上下文工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns/production-integration/context-engineering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"guardrails-injection-defense","title":"安全护栏与提示注入防御","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-application-patterns/production-integration/guardrails-injection-defense"}]}]}